+\-k|\-\-kerberos
+.RS 4
+Try to authenticate with kerberos\&. Only useful in an Active Directory environment\&.
+.RE
+.PP
 \-w target\-workgroup
 .RS 4
 Sets target workgroup or domain\&. You have to specify either this option or the IP address or the name of a server\&.
